# WP-HLOD-WARMUP: the swap between a cell and its HLOD is warmed (WorldPartitionHLODSwitch.hpp, THE WARMUP).
# World: Scenes/WP_Protocol (WP-PROTOCOL.scn). HLOD_Main is switched to MeshSimplify (a built mesh with a baked
# material - its textures are the HLOD's own, drawn by nobody while the cells are shown) and rebuilt; the texture
# pool (Scalability Textures.StreamingPoolMiB) is cut so unseen mips are really dropped and must come back.
# Source: the far flyer 9000003 (Scripts/World/WPFarFly.lua: 0-30 s hold at X=0, 250 m/s, 37-67 s hold at
# X=1800 m, 80-110 s hold at X=5000 m); Player 9000001 off. Main cells: 25 m, LoadingRange 200 m.
# Expected in editor.log ("[WorldPartition] 'WP_Protocol': ..."): cells near X=1800 m "grid 'Main' HLOD of ...
# hidden." only after their warmup (no line "the HLOD warmup of ... ran out of 60 frames" for them, or a few at
# most under the cut pool); when the flyer leaves, "HLOD of ... shown." after the HLOD warmup.
# Lead: confirm the DesertCtl spelling of the pool line (Scalability panel) before the first run.
Проект Projects/Desert/Desert.deproj --scene Content/Scenes/WP_Protocol.desce
Дано run View "View mode: Lit"
Дано set world WorldPartition '{"Grids":[{"Name":"Main","CellSize":2500,"LoadingRange":20000,"Priority":0,"HLODLayer":"HLOD_Main"},{"Name":"Foliage","CellSize":1280,"LoadingRange":6400,"Priority":0,"HLODLayer":"HLOD_Foliage"},{"Name":"LandscapeTiles","CellSize":5000,"LoadingRange":51000,"Priority":0,"HLODLayer":"HLOD_Landscape"}],"HLODLayers":[{"Name":"HLOD_Main","Type":"MeshSimplify"},{"Name":"HLOD_Foliage","Type":"Instancing"},{"Name":"HLOD_Landscape","Type":"Instancing"}],"ChunkRegionSize":100000}'
Дано run Scene "Build HLODs"
Дано run Panel "Open Scalability"
Дано set scalability Textures.StreamingPoolMiB 96
Дано set 9000001 StreamingSourceData.Enabled false
Дано set 9000003 StreamingSourceData.Enabled true
Когда run Mode "Select mode"
Когда run Action "Play from Here"
Когда advance 30
Когда --subject viewport set Camera.Position 150000,6000,-8000
Когда --subject viewport set Camera.Direction 1,-0.25,0.6
Когда advance 7.2
Тогда warmup_no_blur флаер долетел до X=1800 м: ячейки Main у X 1.8 км только что показаны - текстуры зданий чёткие (без мыльного мипа хвоста), ни дыры, ни двойного; в логе HLOD этих ячеек hidden после прогрева
Когда advance 30
Когда --subject viewport set Camera.Position 175000,9000,-20000
Когда --subject viewport set Camera.Direction 0.2,-0.3,1
Когда advance 13.5
Тогда warmup_hlod_sharp флаер ушёл к X=5 км: ячейки у X 1.8 км ушли в HLOD MeshSimplify - запечённые текстуры HLOD сразу чёткие, дыры нет; в логе HLOD of ... shown после прогрева HLOD
Когда run Action "Stop"
